@startuml use_case
title Parallel Search: use cases

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User
note bottom of User
  One user, reaching the service
  through the Web UI, the ./search CLI
  or the HTTP/WebSocket API directly.
end note

rectangle "search service" {
  usecase "Build / rebuild index\n(POST /api/index)" as Build
  usecase "Search without expansion\n(POST /api/search, BM25)" as SearchRest
  usecase "Search with expansion\n(WebSocket /ws/search)" as SearchWs
  usecase "Check health and stats\n(GET /api/health, GET /api/stats)" as Status
}

rectangle "ollama service" as Ollama

User --> Build
User --> SearchRest
User --> SearchWs
User --> Status

SearchWs ..> Ollama : expands the query\n(falls back to the original\nquery if unavailable)
Status ..> Ollama : model available?

note right of SearchRest
  Needs a built index:
  409 while no index exists
  or a build is running.
end note
note right of SearchWs
  Same index requirement;
  stages: query_expansion,
  keyword_search, done.
end note

@enduml
